{"id": "swebq0169", "pool": "swebq", "arm": "aggressive", "tier": "aggressive", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 398732849, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "8c3af78f4533df26d66383d6216ec5cacb9faa8bb324f3d6a6d51641beeea3a9", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.5533501505851746, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "what places are in the west midlands?", "input_path": "/data/bench_audio/swebq0169.wav", "input_sha256": "af52fce3fed68b0a456797fa7cda27264c402c65194d7b3547664bde0d463ec9", "input_samples": 32676, "input_s": 2.042, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.7119, "act": 0.996, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "The West Midlands can mean either the West Midlands county/metropolitan area or the broader West Midlands region of England.", "expert_answer": "The **West Midlands** can mean either the **West Midlands county/metropolitan area** or the broader **West Midlands region** of England.\n\n**West Midlands county** includes places such as:\n\n- **Birmingham**\n- **Coventry**\n- **Wolverhampton**\n- **Dudley**\n- **Walsall**\n- **West Bromwich**\n- **Solihull**\n- **Sutton Coldfield**\n- **Stourbridge**\n- **Halesowen**\n- **Brierley Hill**\n- **Smethwick**\n- **Oldbury**\n- **Tipton**\n- **Bilston**\n- **Willenhall**\n\nThe broader **West Midlands region** also includes counties and areas such as:\n\n- **Staffordshire**\n- **Warwickshire**\n- **Worcestershire**\n- **Shropshire**\n- **Herefordshire**\n- **Stoke-on-Trent**\n- **Telford**\n- **Leamington Spa**\n- **Warwick**\n- **Stratford-upon-Avon**\n- **Worcester**\n- **Hereford**\n- **Shrewsbury**", "transcript": "What places are in the West Midlands?\n", "asr_s": 0.75, "expert_s": 6.31, "expert_input_samples": 32676, "expert_input_s": 2.042, "expert_input_sha256": "af52fce3fed68b0a456797fa7cda27264c402c65194d7b3547664bde0d463ec9", "expert_time